{"ocrText": "75\n\u201cRUMOURS  AGITATING  THE  POPULATION\u201d\nThe Provisional Government is calling upon the \u201cpopula-\ntion\u201d today to stay calm in face of \u201cthe rumours that are being\nspread  in  the  city  and  are  agitating  the  population\u201d.\nDoesn\u2019t the Provisional Government think that one sen-\ntence in the resolution passed by the Congress of Soviets\nis, and should be, a thousand times more agitating than all\n\u201crumours\u201d?  That  sentence  reads:\n\u201cWe know that concealed counter-revolutionaries want\nto  take  advantage  of  your  [Bolshevik]  demonstration.\u201d\nThis is \u201cmore than rumours\u201d. How can they fail to agitate\nthe  population?\nPravda  No.  79,\nPublished  according  to\nJune  24  (11),  1917\nthe  Pravda  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "75", "x": 86.61, "y": 6.06, "w": 2.27, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "\u201c", "x": 16.56, "y": 26.74, "w": 1.91, "h": 2.11, "fontSize": 12.5}, {"text": "RUMOURS", "x": 18.64, "y": 26.9, "w": 14.77, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "AGITATING", "x": 34.87, "y": 26.9, "w": 16.41, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "THE", "x": 52.71, "y": 26.9, "w": 5.92, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "POPULATION", "x": 60.09, "y": 26.9, "w": 19.1, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "\u201d", "x": 79.32, "y": 26.74, "w": 1.91, "h": 2.11, "fontSize": 12.5}, {"text": "The Provisional Government is calling upon the \u201cpopula-", "x": 11.67, "y": 31.41, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "tion\u201d today to stay calm in face of \u201cthe rumours that are being", "x": 8.89, "y": 33.35, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "spread  in  the  city  and  are  agitating  the  population\u201d.", "x": 8.89, "y": 35.29, "w": 70.35, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Doesn\u2019t the Provisional Government think that one sen-", "x": 11.67, "y": 37.22, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "tence in the resolution passed by the Congress of Soviets", "x": 8.89, "y": 39.14, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "is, and should be, a thousand times more agitating than all", "x": 8.89, "y": 41.08, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201crumours\u201d?  That  sentence  reads:", "x": 8.89, "y": 43.02, "w": 44.36, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201cWe know that concealed counter-revolutionaries want", "x": 11.67, "y": 44.96, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "to  take  advantage  of  your  [Bolshevik]  demonstration.\u201d", "x": 8.89, "y": 46.9, "w": 75.76, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "This is \u201cmore than rumours\u201d. How can they", "x": 11.67, "y": 48.84, "w": 58.91, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "fail", "x": 70.99, "y": 48.86, "w": 5.15, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "to agitate", "x": 76.56, "y": 48.84, "w": 12.32, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the  population?", "x": 8.89, "y": 50.76, "w": 20.89, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 10.28, "y": 54.67, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 18.34, "y": 54.65, "w": 3.23, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "79", "x": 22.49, "y": 54.71, "w": 2.03, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 24.74, "y": 54.65, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 66.01, "y": 54.65, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 76.36, "y": 54.65, "w": 9.36, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "to", "x": 86.61, "y": 54.65, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "June", "x": 9.04, "y": 56.01, "w": 4.54, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "24", "x": 14.49, "y": 56.06, "w": 2.12, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 17.63, "y": 56.01, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "11", "x": 18.43, "y": 56.06, "w": 1.69, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 20.36, "y": 56.01, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 22.58, "y": 56.06, "w": 3.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "the", "x": 69.39, "y": 56.01, "w": 2.97, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 73.27, "y": 56.02, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "text", "x": 81.36, "y": 56.01, "w": 3.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}]}